西。",down="hdroom1815",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1818={id="hdroom1818",name="镖局库房",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="库房极大，占了镖局近一半的位置，里面多是放着客人送来的镖物或是准备要送的货物。",right="hdroom1801",roomRoles={},roomItems={"rwwp01","rwwp02","rwwp03","rwwp04"},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"318008",4}},{type="equaltab",args={"318001",1}}}},autoResult1={{type="gaintab",args={"318001",2}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1819={id="hdroom1819",name="平安西街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="正是今年风景美，千红万紫报春光。新春佳节，平安西街两旁的各色店铺大门敞开，首饰店和铁匠铺趁着新春推出了新的货品，一时之间，貌美如花的姑娘们，英武不凡的侠客们，分别将首饰店和铁匠铺围得水泄不通，让店家掌柜招呼不及。",up="hdroom1820",left="hdroom1802",roomRoles={},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom1820={id="hdroom1820",name="西内大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",